    <profile name="Daemon Weapon" id="452f-0e7e-9dde-93b3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
      <comment>Crusade content</comment>
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In the Fight phase, if this model&apos;s unit makes a Dark Pact and fails the resulting Leadership test, until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by this model have the **[HAZARDOUS]** ability.


**Designer&apos;s Note:** *Each Daemon Weapon confers the relevant Chaos God&apos;s keyword on the bearer. If you are using the Pactbound Zealots Detachment, when resolving the Marks of Chaos rule to select a keyword for a unit that has a Daemon Weapon, you must select the same keyword that is conferred by that Daemon Weapon.*</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
