          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly ^^**Heretic Astartes Infantry**^^ unit (excluding Battle-shocked units and ^^**Damned**^^ units) is within 6&quot; of this model, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
