          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle round, when an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move within 9&quot; of this model’s unit, if this model’s unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to D3+3&quot;.</characteristic>
