            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a ranged attack is allocated to a model in that unit, that model has the Benefit of Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
