          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this model is selected to shoot or fight, after resolving its attacks, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks that had the [PSYCHIC] ability. That unit must take a Leadership test: if that test is failed, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
