            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Shooting phase, one PSYKER with this ability can use it. If it does, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of and visible to that PSYKER and roll one D6: on a 1, that PSYKER&apos;s unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 2+, until the start of your next Movement phase, each time an attack targets that enemy unit, improve the Armour Penetration  characteristic of that attack by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
