            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Shooting phase, select one visible enemy ^^**Vehicle^^** unit within 12&quot; of this model and roll one D6: on a 2‑3, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 4‑5, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds; on a 6, that enemy unit suffers D3+3 mortal wounds.’</characteristic>
