          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly ^^**Daemon Vehicle^^** unit is within 6&quot; of this model, add 2 to the Strength characteristic of weapons equipped by models in that unit.</characteristic>
