            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit can have up to two Leader units attached to it, provided no more than one of those units is a Renegade Command Squad unit. If it does, and this Bodyguard unit is destroyed, the Leader units attached to it become separate units, with their original Starting Strengths.</characteristic>
