            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In the Fight phase, after this model has finished making its attacks, if this model destroyed one or more enemy units this phase, each enemy unit within 6&quot; of this model must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
