            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time the bearer&apos;s unit destroys an enemy unit, you gain one Bloodshed point. Each time you make a Blessings of Khorne roll, roll one additional D6 for each Bloodshed point you have, after which, all your Bloodshed points are lost.</characteristic>
