            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a model in this unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that is below its Starting Strength, add 1 to the Hit roll. If that enemy unit is Below Half-strength, add 1 to the Wound roll as well.</characteristic>
