        <profile name="Torturous Spite" id="d166-3454-d2ee-98e0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model&apos;s unit is selected as a target for a charge, roll a D6. On a roll of 3-6, subtract 2 from that enemy unit&apos;s charge roll. Before the charge roll, the enemy unit can select a different target for the charge.</characteristic>
