                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, when an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move within 9&quot; of the bearers model, this model can use its Venom Sphere. If it does, roll one D6: on a 2+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. Only one model from your army with this ability can use it in the same battle round.</characteristic>
