          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is attached to a unit, each time this unit makes a ranged attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1 if the target is within 12&quot;.</characteristic>
