        <profile name="Cortex Designator" id="e5ca-5d81-5138-0056" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; and visible to this model. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly Vehicle unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, improve the Ballistic Skill of that attack by 1.</characteristic>
