              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The bearer gains the **^^Khorne^^** keyword. In the Fight phase, if the bearer&apos;s unit makes a Dark Pact, until the end of the phase, add 3 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the bearer and add 1 to the Damage characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the bearer.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
